<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
    <head>
        <link rel="stylesheet" href = "/css/global.css">
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/about.css">
        <title>About Page</title>
    </head>
    
    <body>
        <div class="parent">
        {{> header currentUser=currentUser }}
            <main class="about-container">
            <h1 class="page-title">About Page</h1>
            
            <section class="card">
                <h2>What is Off Beat?</h2>
                <p>Welcome to Off Beat, the ultimate community-driven hub dedicated to maimai DX chart reviews and difficulty discussions. Every maimai player knows the feeling: clearing a chart that feels perfectly rated, or getting completely washed by a level that feels severely underrated. We created this platform to give players a dedicated space to share those exact sentiments. Whether you are a seasoned veteran grinding for your next Dan rank or a newer player trying to navigate the difficulty folders, this is your space to speak up.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="card">
                <h2>What You Can Do Here</h2>
                <div class="feature">
                    <h3>Submit Chart Reviews</h3>
                    <p>Share your detailed thoughts, tips, and gameplay experiences on specific charts.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature">
                    <h3>Debate Ratings</h3>
                    <p>Vote and discuss whether a chart's official rating is accurate, overrated, or an absolute trap.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature">
                    <h3>Find Your Next Play</h3>
                    <p>Use community feedback to find the best charts for practicing specific patterns or pushing your personal rating.</p>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="card">
                <h2>Our Mission</h2>
                <p>To bring arcade rhythm gamers together, share valuable insights, and grow the global maimai DX community. Grab your gloves, join the discussion, and let’s figure out these charts together!</p>
            </section>

            <section class="card">
                <h2>Packages Used</h2>
                <ul class="packages-list">
                    <li>node-rs/argon2</li>
                    <li>express</li>
                    <li>express-fileupload</li>
                    <li>express-session</li>
                    <li>express-validator</li>
                    <li>hbs</li>
                    <li>mongoose</li>
                    <li>mongoose-lean-virtuals</li>
                    <li>dompurify</li>
                    <li>dotenv</li>
                    <li>jsdom</li>
                    <li>marked</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

